PPM (Wolfgang Ibl) - reads the portable graymap and pixmap formats (.pgm, .ppm), plain (P2, P3)
and raw (P5, P6), and raw bitmaps (.pbm, P4)

  With this package, Pictures.Open reads them (pbm, pgm, ppm = PPM.InitPicture in the section
  PictureConverters of Oberon.Text), so every program that shows pictures shows them.
